      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file named `vision_client.py` that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Static Image and Visual Understanding. This implies integrating with a cloud-based vision API service. I will choose Amazon Rekognition as the service for this integration due to its comprehensive image and video analysis capabilities. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK components and set up a client for Amazon Rekognition. </thinking>\n",
